{"parse": {"title": "TMW-07", "pageid": 119356, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-06\" title=\"TMW-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TMW-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-08\" title=\"TMW-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TMW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.9A.E7.91.99.E9.BB.8E.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"多瑙黎明\">多瑙黎明</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 多瑙黎明</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Danube Dawn</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>行<span class=\"color-value\"></span>车<span class=\"color-value\"></span>条<span class=\"color-value\"></span>令<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>：<span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瑙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>黎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>明<span class=\"color-value\"></span>号<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>服<span class=\"color-value\"></span>务<span class=\"color-value\"></span>全<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瑙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>河<span class=\"color-value\"></span>流<span class=\"color-value\"></span>域<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>民<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3110107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>非法拘禁——非法拘禁——放我出去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-312516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-312516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-312516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>放我出去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩大声叫嚷着，右耳紧贴在门背上，恨不得要将自己整个儿塞进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嗒嗒，嗒……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声越来越轻，伴随着回音在空旷的走廊里逐渐消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>嗯……终于走远了！接下来嘛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从破布条中抽出一根金属小玩意儿，凑近门锁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>想把我关起来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>这么个门锁可难不倒我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>好耶，成了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门悄无声息地打开了一道缝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>很好，附近没有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>轻松搞定。不愧是你，野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她双手叉腰，正准备向自由迈出一步——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>小树莓？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你、你从什么地方冒出来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾玛指了指背后。当门打开时，小乘务员的身影便被这扇门给牢牢挡住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你，我，呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未曾料想的情况使女孩陷入了短暂的大脑空白。错过了最佳的辩解时机，女孩只能放弃挣扎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>好吧，你想怎么办？要去给你的老大打小报告吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>嘘……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员伸出食指放在嘴唇上，朝野树莓眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-637312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>小声一点，他们会听见的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>你好像在害怕，我能闻到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>害怕？那你恐怕还不了解我。所以……你会告诉她们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>没关系。只要你不乱跑，我不会告诉她们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员左右张望一眼后，走入室内，轻轻关上房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你、你想做什么？列车长她们人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯小姐说她还需要查阅一点儿有关列车的资料，两个人现在一同待在守车里呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>放心吧，不会有事的。一个人看门总是容易犯困……不如我们来聊聊天吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员轻巧地坐上沙发，拍了拍身旁的空位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩看了看自己黑乎乎的手心和裤脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我身上不干净，会弄脏你的沙发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>没关系……我是沙发的主人，我说了算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温声的宽慰并未起到应有的作用。女孩仍旧站在原地，仿佛双腿生了根。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>既然你不愿意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员忽然合掌一拍，灵光一闪般抓起野树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>那我来给你换一件衣服，这样你总愿意和我一块坐下来了吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-312519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你，你要做什么……哎哟，你力气好大……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这件，还有这件……找到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>来，看看这件！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这看起来……真可爱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>合身吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>非常、非常、非常合身！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>现在我宣布，这件衣服是你的了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>真、真的吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天晓得她多久没换过一身干净衣服了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红白相间的针脚紧密相扣，在裙摆上画出一个美丽的弧度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩一眨也不眨地看着它们，说不出一个拒绝的字眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>谢谢你，艾玛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>对了。这里有这么多衣服，为什么没有镜子呀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员羞赧地摸了摸右眼的眼罩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我、我的眼睛不好看，不习惯照镜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>真是胡说！你明明那样好看，那样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……总之，你什么都很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说完她挠了挠头，勉强将视线调转到眼前衣物堆积的小山上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>以前我也有这么大一柜子东西，绸子的、羊毛的，纱的……什么料子都有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>这么多衣服，都是你自己收藏的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>不是哦，大多是我的家人送给我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>他说乘务员的生活太单调了，就连制服也是……所以只要出了远门，他就会带新的衣服给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这样我穿上新衣服的时候，就好像也陪家人一起去了那些地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>家人……哼，确实挺单调的。我像你这么大的时候，已经一个人跑过很多地方啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>哈哈，你的生活听上去好精彩呀！不过我觉得，在列车上也不错呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>看着不同的乘客上上下下，每天都有新的故事。对我来说，这也是一种“旅行”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>还有列车长，她虽然总是板着脸，但一直都在照顾我们。不仅如此，她还是一位顶好的裁缝呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩指向车窗边摆放着的一排套娃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>你看！这些娃娃身上的衣服也是她亲手织的，是不是很可爱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>套娃们身着保暖的、花色活泼的小毛衣，朝野树莓露出整齐划一的、憨厚且无害的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-312524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我有个问题，艾玛。这趟列车上该不会有两个列车长吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-312525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-312525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-312525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>不然我实在难以想象……不，我完全无法想象……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野树莓狠狠甩头，试图甩开意外涌入脑海的诡异场景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>列车长？织毛衣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>不……光是想象这个场景，就已经叫人很害怕了……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>列车长女士，您的东西掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红色的线团滚落到正在一旁整理资料的调查员脚边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员拾起它，无比自然地递到列车长身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>谢谢。有关列车的资料都在这里了，行车日志在左边第一个抽屉，交接班记录本在右边第二个抽屉最底层，调度指令就在桌上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我明白了，感谢您的配合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叮嘱完成后，列车长继续织起手中长长的围巾，不声不响地坐在沙发上“陪伴”着调查员的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>难得和平的共处时光。或许，这也是一个了解对方的好机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很整齐的针脚。真没有想到，您的业余爱好是针线活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>在我的家乡，所有人都会这个。这不稀奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>生硬的语调，生硬的收尾。话题终结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员只得继续翻阅手头的文件。无数列车的参数和零件一一略过，调查员看了一会儿，再度寻找到了一个话题的突破口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>“多瑙黎明”……我一直觉得这个名字很有趣。它的背后有什么寓意吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车厢内一片寂静，只余车轮摩擦在铁轨上单调而冗长的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话题再度终结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>抱歉。我似乎忘了，我们之间不是能坐在一起闲聊的友爱关系……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>把多瑙河沿岸的所有地区，联合在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>刚才你问我，“多瑙黎明”名字背后的寓意。我现在正在回答你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长停顿了一下，静静地看着调查员的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>其实很简单，和它字面的意思一样：把多瑙河沿岸的所有地区联合在一起，然后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>一起驶向明天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>联合在一起？怎么个联合法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一头，两个女孩并肩靠在柔软的沙发上，感受着身下轮毂行进时带来的震颤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>从伊斯坦布尔一路走到维也纳，中间经过贝尔格莱德、尼卡和布达佩斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手指在半空中轻盈地划出一条蜿蜒的弧线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>你瞧，是不是正好将多瑙河沿岸的地区都包含在内了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>联合起来……真讽刺，现在他们正打得不可开交呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>哎呀……我也弄不清楚大人们的事情，太复杂啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我只知道我很喜欢这个名字。“多瑙黎明”，听上去很温暖，就像一个大家庭一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>其实，刚才你说的那些话我也很赞同！为什么大人不能坐下来，扔掉那些帽子，好好谈谈呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野树莓雀跃起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哈哈，你也同意我的观点是吧！我就知道我们合得来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>当然。我喜欢人类，也喜欢神秘学家，血食怪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她偷偷看了一眼野树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>你还是我见到的第一个血食怪呢！这种感觉很新奇，我很喜欢你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>嗯哼！我也……不讨厌你。不过我很好奇，像你这样的家伙……你有不喜欢的人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员仰起头，仔细思索了一番。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>……好像没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哼，我就知道。大家都喜欢你，你也喜欢大家。你是个幸福的小公主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“小公主”点点头，大方接受了新朋友略带酸意的点评。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我很感激自己能拥有这样的生活，所以我希望你们也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>大家能和平共处最好啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻握住野树莓的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>就像这样，你看——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeitietie\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeitietie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeitietie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>五根手指，原本各自分开，彼此孤单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>可一旦握紧，它们就成了一体，再也分不开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哼，这有什么。只要我想，随时都能挣脱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她往后缩了一点，艾玛的手却依旧扣在她掌心，温柔而坚定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>你希望挣脱开吗？小树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人的皮肤都很白，白得几乎透明，手背上青色的血管若隐若现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，她们掌心相贴，那些细细的脉络也仿佛悄然缠绕、连接在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>联合多瑙河沿岸，一起驶向明天？真是意想不到的愿景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昔日的创始人们全票通过了这个名字，那时他们的心中没有阴影，眼里盛满光明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们坚信，多瑙河永不停歇，它将一直流向未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>真正的理想主义，自然……也很不切实际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>虽然我不理解，但我敬佩他们对信念的执着——至少在说出那些话的时候，他们是真诚而坚定的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之外的回应让列车长短暂沉默了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>针尖仍旧在柔软的织物中穿梭。列车长的眼神变得温柔而专注。她先用左手将线圈绕过右针的头，再熟练地把线从上方拉回……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每一次拉紧毛线，织物便更加紧密，在她的指尖下结成坚不可破的堡垒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再度开口时，她的声音带上了几分柔和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>对我来说都没有区别，我只负责完成我的本职工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>十三节车厢，一个不少，我会把大家都平安带到安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>十三节，你确定吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员敏锐地捕捉到了这个关键的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>没有哪趟列车会选用这个倒霉的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>针尖停滞了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>加上火车头的话……可以是十三。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>你不能说火车头不算一节“车厢”。这只是一个简单的定义问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……好吧，那祝你顺利，列车长女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>毕竟，把大家平安带到安全的地方是我们共同的期望。我说得对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>当然。让你在这里自由地查阅资料，这就是我的“照应”。现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一针终于完成，列车长停下了手中的活计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，一条松软的红色围巾静静地躺在她的膝上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很漂亮。我想艾玛会喜欢的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-313210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-313210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-313210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笑意一闪而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长的视线越过调查员，看向挂钟，确认时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>你的资料查阅工作有进展了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>也不算全无收获。我找到了一批预定乘客的信息，可以用于参考对照，以防部分乘客没有说实话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>那很好。我们已经在这里待得够久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>走吧，调查员，继续你的职责。我还有其他工作，接下来可能要失陪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>没关系。合作愉快，列车长女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她与列车长一同开门离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>室外风雪吹袭，列车正疾行平静的夜色之中。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TMW-07"}}